From e19898b48f6624811f1526670793305a95da9d6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hectorqin <14220132+hectorqin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:39:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] fix(sidebar): close the mobile drawer for child rows and
 mark their background work

Tapping a child that runs in the already-selected project left the
mobile drawer open, because only a project change closed it and child
rows must not select the listing project. Session picks now take a
closeSidebar option, which compact child rows pass; the chosen session
is kept.

A child whose turn ended but whose background work still runs showed
only its age and looked finished; it now shows the background-work
indicator and tooltip normal rows use.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
